    (h.req "01a1b49c-ac2b-753a-83fc-2379ba815ac4"
      "Our own Put, which names the demo key in full where the stock peer used its alias, is split by the same rule as the stock peer's, so its bodies are the host reference's and not the captured ones: a 5000-byte payload at a 2048-byte batch with a first sequence number of 1000 gives the three bodies the reference computes, and the checker holds each to its length, header and sha256. A message travels whole in a FRAME when the frame's header, its sequence number and the message fit the batch less the stream length, and is fragmented when they do not: at a 2048-byte batch and sequence number 1000 the largest payload that travels whole is 1872 bytes, and one byte more is two fragments."
